## Jira Integration

### Project Key: AUDIT

### Ticket Types I Create

| Type | Label | Purpose | Example |
|------|-------|---------|---------|
| Finding | [FINDING] | Audit finding | [FINDING] SOUL violation: Arbiter missed grading SLA |
